 "边界与参数来源", "originalText": "边界与参数来源", "fontSize": 23, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.35}, {"id": "3b7b85809e2e4d4897f0bc383bae5bb5", "type": "text", "x": 3958.9963100435825, "y": 1557, "width": 157.6, "height": 27.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#f38b96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790954007259, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Tx · 角域全宽", "originalText": "Tx · 角域全宽", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.35}, {"id": "504021f7b03240728b68ebd85592ec0b", "type": "text", "x": 3958.9963100435825, "y": 1593, "width": 284.32, "height": 48.6, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#cbd5e1", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790954007259, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "H 3.00 × V 17.45 mrad\n等价 H 0.17 × V 1.00 deg", "originalText": "H 3.00 × V 17.45 mrad\n等价 H 0.17 × V 1.00 deg", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.35}, {"id": "4b13ed2b01c04641bade3f5fe63c2f63", "type": "text", "x": 3958.9963100435825, "y": 1673, "width": 198.4, "height": 27.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#7db6ec", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790954007259, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Rx · 配置接收角域", "originalText": "Rx · 配置接收角域", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.35}, {"id": "df1426e04918476eb3bd5f7b349c607d", "type": "text", "x": 3958.9963100435825, "y": 1709, "width": 284.32, "height": 48.6, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#cbd5e1", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790954007259, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "H 4.00 × V 17.45 mrad\n等价 H 0.23 × V 1.00 deg", "originalText": "H 4.00 × V 17.45 mrad\n等价 H 0.23 × V 1.00 deg", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.35}, {"id": "6fe10c7c95e74add894d36d8a4bcf97a", "type": "text", "x": 3958.9963100435825, "y": 1789, "width": 341.20000000000005, "height": 27.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#5ee3b7", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790954007259, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "SPAD · 实际 cell / binning", "originalText": "SPAD · 实际 cell / binning", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.35}, {"id": "fb0230f45b8d4cd69874c6ed6b2c0941", "type": "text", "x": 3958.9963100435825, "y": 1827, "width": 296.2, "height": 72.9, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#cbd5e1", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790954007259, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "4 × 4 cells；pitch 20 μm\n分组 H 80 × V 80 μm\n对应 H 4.00 × V 4.00 mrad", "originalText": "4 × 4 cells；pitch 20 μm\n分组 H 80 × V 80 μm\n对应 H 4.00 × V 4.00 mrad", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.35}, {"id": "acb8adff069e4445a56543e741c2d64d", "type": "text", "x": 3958.9963100435825, "y": 1933, "width": 251.92000000000002, "height": 72.9, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#94a3b8", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790954007259, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "绿色细实线：cell 边界\n绿色粗实线：binning 外框\n灰色等间距虚线：坐标网格", "originalText": "绿色细实线：cell 边界\n绿色粗实线：binning 外框\n灰色等间距虚线：坐标网格", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.35}, {"id": "2b6d94599384407fa1cebfcd2023c324", "type": "text", "x": 3958.9963100435825, "y": 2033, "width": 251.92000000000002, "height": 97.2, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#94a3b8", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790954007259, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "本例 H 边界近似重合，\n是参数计算结果；\n改变焦距、偏移或 binning\n后各框独立变化。", "originalText": "本例 H 边界近似重合，\n是参数计算结果；\n改变焦距、偏移或 binning\n后各框独立变化。", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.35}, {"id": "466fe346251640de81f4ae6a0d856a87", "type": "text", "x": 3080.9963100435825, "y": 2229, "width": 938.8000000000001, "height": 32.400000000000006, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#5ee3b7", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790954007259, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "滤光后 477.45 → 探测面 101.62 光子    |    PSF 空间截获率 21.28%", "originalText": "滤光后 477.45 → 探测面 101.62 光子    |    PSF 空间截获率 21.28%", "fontSize": 24, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.35}, {"id": "cdcbf5cc2a07441ba4b0ffa0446043e3", "type": "text", "x": 3080.9963100435825, "y": 2277, "width": 692.5600000000001, "height": 24.3, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#94a3b8", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790954007259, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "网格按主角度坐标等间距；副坐标用精确 tan 映射，因此 μm 数值不严格等差。", "originalText": "网格按主角度坐标等间距；副坐标用精确 tan 映射，因此 μm 数值不严格等差。", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.35}, {"id": "40859cd1faca4e54b929c8ce86b1d7b5", "type": "text", "x": 3080.9963100435825, "y": 2315, "width": 852.52, "height": 22.950000000000003, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#94a3b8", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790954007259, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "倒置映射：X像 = −fH·tan(H) + X偏移；Y像 = −fV·tan(V) + Y偏移。像面轴不是ZMAX全局轴。", "originalText": "倒置映射：X像 = −fH·tan(H) + X偏移；Y像 = −fV·tan(V) + Y偏移。像面轴不是ZMAX全局轴。", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.35}, {"id": "358517963308445c9015c7b45ad54e9b", "type": "text", "x": 3080.9963100435825, "y": 2353, "width": 720.6400000000001, "height": 24.3, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#94a3b8", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790954007259, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "本图为几何边界对照；实际截获率仍由公共 Python 核心逐角域 / PSF 积分得到。", "originalText": "本图为几何边界对照；实际截获率仍由公共 Python 核心逐角域 / PSF 积分得到。", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.35}], "appState": {"viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff"}, "files": {}}